  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The seminar will serve to facilitate national and regional dialog on control and eradication of animal diseases. The seminar will create awareness of existing knowledge at the regional (ASEAN) level on animal diseases, and highlight the value of investing in adequate measures to handle the spread of these diseases.</narrative>
